    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf85 <strong>Work Hard. Play Santa.</strong> \ud83c\udf84</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wished you could save Christmas while crunching spreadsheets or watching cat videos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/345b3a53263c677e4ba0289f293ed031.poster.avif?t=1734245385\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/345b3a53263c677e4ba0289f293ed031.webm?t=1734245385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/345b3a53263c677e4ba0289f293ed031.mp4?t=1734245385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Well, now you can! <i>Santa Gamepaper</i> is here to make multitasking merry with a game that runs seamlessly at the bottom of your screen. You\u2019ll be juggling cookies, presents, and productivity like a holiday pro!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/230a93219730ef3f18b73421df7e470f.poster.avif?t=1734245385\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/230a93219730ef3f18b73421df7e470f.webm?t=1734245385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/230a93219730ef3f18b73421df7e470f.mp4?t=1734245385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>What\u2019s in the Sack?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD Your Way to Victory!</strong> Guide Santa as he dashes through snowy fields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse-Toss Presents!</strong> Aim, throw, and watch those naughty kids magically turn nice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect All the Cookies!</strong> Because Santa deserves snacks too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Santa\u2019s Sleigh!</strong> Save reindeers by helping good kids. Unlock the sleigh to zoom across the snow and collect cookies even faster!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work-Friendly Fun!</strong> Run the game right on your desktop while pretending to send emails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holiday Spirit Everywhere!</strong> Snow, sparkles, and Santa\u2014it\u2019s all here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re procrastinating or multitasking like a Christmas champion, <i>Santa Gamepaper</i> is the perfect way to spread joy without missing a deadline. Save Christmas one cookie at a time\u2014and maybe even keep your boss in the dark! \ud83c\udf81\ud83c\udf6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop reading, start playing, and let Santa bring the holiday cheer! \ud83c\udf85</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf85 <strong>Work Hard. Play Santa.</strong> \ud83c\udf84</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wished you could save Christmas while crunching spreadsheets or watching cat videos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/345b3a53263c677e4ba0289f293ed031.poster.avif?t=1734245385\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/345b3a53263c677e4ba0289f293ed031.webm?t=1734245385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/345b3a53263c677e4ba0289f293ed031.mp4?t=1734245385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Well, now you can! <i>Santa Gamepaper</i> is here to make multitasking merry with a game that runs seamlessly at the bottom of your screen. You\u2019ll be juggling cookies, presents, and productivity like a holiday pro!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/230a93219730ef3f18b73421df7e470f.poster.avif?t=1734245385\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/230a93219730ef3f18b73421df7e470f.webm?t=1734245385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377990/extras/230a93219730ef3f18b73421df7e470f.mp4?t=1734245385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>What\u2019s in the Sack?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD Your Way to Victory!</strong> Guide Santa as he dashes through snowy fields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse-Toss Presents!</strong> Aim, throw, and watch those naughty kids magically turn nice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect All the Cookies!</strong> Because Santa deserves snacks too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Santa\u2019s Sleigh!</strong> Save reindeers by helping good kids. Unlock the sleigh to zoom across the snow and collect cookies even faster!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work-Friendly Fun!</strong> Run the game right on your desktop while pretending to send emails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holiday Spirit Everywhere!</strong> Snow, sparkles, and Santa\u2014it\u2019s all here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re procrastinating or multitasking like a Christmas champion, <i>Santa Gamepaper</i> is the perfect way to spread joy without missing a deadline. Save Christmas one cookie at a time\u2014and maybe even keep your boss in the dark! \ud83c\udf81\ud83c\udf6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop reading, start playing, and let Santa bring the holiday cheer! \ud83c\udf85</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83c\udf85 The ONLY game where you pretend to work while Santa runs, munches cookies, and hurls presents at naughty kids! Play discreetly at the bottom of your screen, multitask like a holiday boss, and save Christmas one cookie at a time. \ud83c\udf6a\ud83c\udf81",
